----------------------
```vbnet

Pre-processing removes the influence of white spaces in the text string. Without pre-processing,
"1 2 TROIS 4 cinq SIX" is treated as single word, therefor without pronunciation and no explicit reading style.
With pre-processing, "1 2 TROIS 4 cinq SIX" becomes "[one] [two] [trois] [quatre] [cinq] [six]" that has six
pronunciation.

